<h1>prune and search</h1>
<p>
(algorithmic technique)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
Find an <a href="optimalvalue.html"><em>optimal value</em></a> by eliminating a constant fraction of remaining objects at each step.  Eliminated objects are guaranteed not to affect the optimal value.  A <a href="logarithmic.html"><em>logarithmic</em></a> number of steps reduces the number of objects to a constant, and a <a href="bruteforce.html"><em>brute force</em></a> approach can then solve it.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Also known as</strong> decimation.
</p>


<p>
<em>Note:
Adapted from <a href="../terms.html#AS98">[AS98, page 422]</a>.</em>
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

